			<div class="content" id="post-content-4811286">
									

<p>A (small) yellow squid-shaped-sponge object with a dark-yellow-hole that cuts any alive being that enters it (w/certain-affects). It leaks a strange goo afterwords.</p>
<p><strong>Seeking-Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page-Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Horror</p>
<p><strong>Page-Layout:</strong></p>
<p>Normal SCP-article Format</p>
<p>DISCOVERY=:=Findings-of-SCP by Dr.-K<br />
AUDIO-LOG=:=Added-detail-of-discovery<br />
INVESTIGATION=:=Investigation-of &quot;mush&quot; from Dr.-A<br />
ROUTINE-PROTOCOL=:=Process-the-Foundation-goes-over due-to the-discovery<br />
&quot;ALLOWED-OBJECTS-LIST&quot;=:=Same-as-above<br />
EXPERIMENT-LOG=:=Explains-Foundation's-testing-with-D-Bois from Dr. A &amp; Dr. B<br />
TEST-CHART=:=Explains-Foundation's-numerous-testing-for-SCP by Dr.-A &amp; B<br />
FOOTNOTES=:=Explains Dr. A's disappearance</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central-Narrative:</strong></p>
<p>The-theme is to explain how such a harmless-object causes such a reaction with the facility, showing how over-prepared the Foundation is when it comes-to SCPs.</p>
<p>The Foundation found the SCP in site-45. It was discovered in a bathroom sink by one of the doctors (we'll call him Dr.-K) in the facility. Dr.-K didn't realize the SCP was an anomalous-object and so (supposedly) grabbed it. According to audio-logs, it can be assumed that Dr.-K accidentally had been cut from the SCP. Only his blood-samples, finger/toe-nails, and skin-tissue were found on the sink and ground by 2 guards after 9 minutes from supposed-cutting. Site-managers were called-in and MTF surrounded the SCP. They first-believed the SCP to be a moving-anomaly, but after 15-minutes under-watch, they decided to capture it w/a long-reach-claw.</p>
<p>The Foundation decided-to investigate the-sink that the SCP came from. They found several bits of &quot;unidentifiable-mush&quot; in the sink and drain-pipe. After the-discovery, all pipes in the site were inspected and all staff-personnel were to use materials from site-23 for the next month.</p>
<p>Dr.-K's-body was never found and the-SCP was taken-in study. Due to this incident, the 05-council have enacted a routine-check once a week of every bathroom w/every facility by at least two MTF. All-bathrooms have an &quot;allowed-objects&quot; list (w/list-addendum), and any-other objects found-by personnel must-now be reported to site-managers for inspection.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<em>As a courtesy to our readers on mobile devices, please collapse long posts. ~Zyn</em>
<p>More is-explored in audio-logs, addendums, and test-logs by two main researchers, Dr.-A &amp; Dr.-B</p>
<p>(Read my replies below this post)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Read&nbsp;More</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Read&nbsp;Less?</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Elevator-Pitch:</strong></p>
<p>The SCP has a small-dark-yellow-hole that can cut things (similar to a garbage disposal).</p>
<p>Restrictions:</p>
<ul>
<li>Only cuts the object in the hole if it is alive or connected to an alive being.</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>(Ex: A connected-human-finger would work cause it is connected. A cut-off-human-finger wouldn't work)</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Affects-on-being-cut:</p>
<ul>
<li>If the body-part/entity has a toenail when entering the hole (ex: finger), it makes the entire entity's nails be cut off.</li>
<li>A dark-orange goo is leaked and it can make entities disapear</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong></p>
<p>It expresses my strange-fear of getting cut.<br />
The SCP isn't just anomalous for anomalous-sake, it's to express the fear I've had into an object.</p>
<p><strong>Additional-Notes:</strong> None.</p>
</div>
